WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.230
<b>Original Story by Kenjiro Hata</b>

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.980
Have you ever kissed anyone?

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.520
Please let me kiss you!

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.110
I have to get that kiss...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.610
I want to kiss you!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.110
Kiss!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:12.890
Kiss!

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:13.570
Kiss!

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.470
Kiss!

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:48.670
Chapter 1: Who's Knocking on the Door?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.670
Long time no see, Hayate Ayasaki.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.590
This is inside your dream.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:04.680
In English, that's "in your dream"!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.690
Ow! That hurts! What are you doing?!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.190
I wanted to see if it's really a dream.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.010
Jeez...

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.980
But today is the last day 
you'll be so confident!

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:18.700
Soon, the cries of the black camellia

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.490
will plunge you into the 
depths of misfortune!

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.520
Black... camellia?

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.710
Hey. It's been a long time.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.910
Hi!

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.710
Hi!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.760
I'm the guy inside the black camellia.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:38.990
In English, it's "nice to meet you!"

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.320
Why'd you kick me?!

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.050
Well?

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:48.290
There seem to be two creepy, 
mysterious creatures here.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.350
What do you want?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.880
Don't call us creepy!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.750
Treat us as mascots!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.070
Like things with "-pon" 
or "-mon" in their names!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.490
That's right!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.670
Okay, Freakamon it is.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:58.740
Look, you!

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:00.740
Well? What do you want?

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.540
Well, the thing is...

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.240
We have a big favor to ask.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.930
What was that dream all about?

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.820
Hayate-kun, it's about seven!

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.810
Could you wake Nagi, please?

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:28.930
Yes!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.650
Miss Nagi, please wake up.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.850
It's morning.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:43.130
I guess this is no different
 from the usual...

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.950
At last, the gold...

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.600
Go buy some enoki mushrooms...

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.410
You two creepy-looking creatures...

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:58.170
Maria-san, you were with
 Miss Nagi last night, right?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.460
Was she up late?

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:04.210
Yes... Actually, now 
that you mention it,

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.100
I don't remember how late she was awake.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.160
I guess I fell asleep 
before I knew it, too...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.980
Um, Maria-san...

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:16.980
Have you ever kissed anyone?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:18.820
What?!

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:23.110
Wh-What are you saying so early 
in the morning, Hayate-kun?!

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.350
Okay. I guess not.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.280
I guess that never could've happened...

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.330
Wh-What was that all about?!

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.840
Hey, where's Hina-san?

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:42.220
Is she still asleep?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.800
Certainly not. She's already 
on her way to school.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.840
Of course she is!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.590
By the way, ladies...

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.760
Have a little kisu...

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:54.300
...that I picked up today, even 
though it's out of season.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:56.850
Go on, while it's hot.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.340
Kisu...

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.010
Kisu...

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:06.970
Indeed! Kisu is the Japanese name for fish

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.230
[Order]
[Suborder]
[Family]

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.350
<b>Kisu</b>

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.410
in the order Perciformes, suborder 
Percoidei, family Sillaginidae!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.830
It can also mean...

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.320
kiss.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.500
I-I need to get going!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.920
Y-Yeah, me, too!

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.010
Later!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.660
Could that dream have been...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.980
No, that kind of nonsense couldn't be true.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.620
Okay...

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:42.110
We'll call this a little 
insurance, just in case!

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:50.870
Please let me kiss you!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.640
Incompetent fool!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.580
<b>In Your Dream</b>

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:00.580
Do you understand

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.620
the gravity of the situation?

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.820
And after we went to the trouble 
of giving the girls this dream...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.740
Please let me kiss you!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:17.020
It's to help someone!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.490
What are you trying to do?!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.570
Ow, ow! Break! Break!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.940
We're trying to help you!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.950
Well, stop butting in!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.450
Please, not the Palo Special!

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.450
What is with you guys?!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.910
Still, I can't believe we all...

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.500
Had a dream...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.290
Of Hayata-kun...

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.260
Kissing us.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.680
Yo, lover boy!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.220
Please don't say that.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.510
But the situation seems to be 
more dire than I thought.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.430
Anyway, he's supposed 
to kiss someone, right?

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.630
Well, we've got Izumi for that!

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.230
What?!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.310
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.350
Don't worry.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.400
Despite how she looks, 
Izumi is quite the little bitch.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.500
A kiss or two is nothing to her.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.370
Who are you calling a bitch?!

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.110
Plus...

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.190
We of the Video Research Club will film

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.530
every second and upload 
the video to the internet.

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.500
No problem.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.690
That's nothing but problems!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:22.670
You really don't want 
Izumi to be the one?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.300
What are you even saying?!

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:25.840
No choice, then.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.840
It's up to you, Hina.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:29.210
What?!

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:39.850
Wa— No! A kiss is...

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.720
Jeez, what was that dream, anyway?

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:08.550
Please let me kiss you!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.890
What's the meaning of this?

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.930
Uh...

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.230
<i>The only one who seems 
like she'd let me do it</i>

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:33.240
<i>if I explained the 
circumstances is Hinagiku-san...</i>

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.800
<i>If I told her that...</i>

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:35.910
Hayate-kun.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.240
Are you listening to me?

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:42.410
<i>...I bet she'd get really mad.</i>

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.720
Forget it. Class is starting, anyway.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.710
We'll talk about this 
in detail over lunch.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:52.970
You can't!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.050
You're not even a couple!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.710
It has to at least be someone 
who loves Hayata-kun!

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:02.180
Even then, I think it 
would be difficult.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.930
Aika-san?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:03.930
Where'd she come from?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.840
Think about it.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:12.280
He is indecisive, dense, 
insensitive, and broke.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.670
He may have monsterous 
physical strength,

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:16.780
but he's not all that smart.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.810
He's predisposed to misfortune, 
and he's always getting into trouble.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.920
One would have to be truly twisted

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.440
to fall for a troublesome guy like him.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.250
No need to worry.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:36.050
There are people twisted enough 
to love troublesome guys like him.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:39.640
Well?

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:43.310
Why did you call me out here?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.250
W-Well...

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:47.810
Listen, Yukiji...

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:51.150
If you're free tonight, 
we could go out to eat or...

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:56.080
What? Why should I 
have to eat with you?

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.950
Then, how about drinks?

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.160
Really?!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.910
Okay! Your treat!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.500
I want Dom Perignon Rose!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.750
The really expensive stuff!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.200
No Dom Perignon Rose!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.080
I'll treat you to anything 
that's not expensive!

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.070
Yay!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.310
Yay! Yay!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:19.970
I get to drink for free!

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:34.860
How's that?!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.580
Wait... Mr. Kaoru likes my sister?!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.970
You're just seeing this?!

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.610
How dense can you be?!

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.610
You really didn't know?!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:50.790
Let's go grab lunch.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.920
Sure.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.330
Harukaze? Why are you...

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.810
Nothing, just...

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:05.500
There's a book out today that I really want.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.470
R-Really?

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.850
But, during lunch break?

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.480
Go back to school, all right?

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.480
<b>Bar Guide  
Bars that college girls, 
office ladies, 
and childhood 
girl friends will love</b>

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.400
<i>Twisted, huh...</i>

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.410
<i>But...</i>

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.700
<b>I Usually Keep My Cool, 
But Since I Dreamed 
of That Kiss...</b>

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.030
<i>Even I...</i>

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:31.590
<i>What exactly was that dream about?</i>

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:35.410
Let us upload the video 
as "Izumi's kissing face"!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:35.750
<i>Still...</i>

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.310
What?! No way!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:39.010
<i>This many people who dreamed about kissing...</i>

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.590
<i>Then, maybe...</i>

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.270
<i>what those two 
Freakamon said was really...</i>

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.160
Cut it out, you guys!

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:47.990
Excuse me!

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.380
I'll be leaving early today!

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:50.180
Hey—

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.690
Hayate-kun!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.270
Sakuya, we should go, too.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:58.900
Huh?

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:01.400
Go where?

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:10.120
Didn't the black camellia lose 
that weird power already?

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.850
When we went to Las Vegas...

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:14.540
Yeah, but this is what 
we're dealing with now.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.460
Circumstances beyond our 
control, you might say.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.270
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:22.200
I can't really answer that...

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.110
Again?

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.300
What a slave driver...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.300
Don't give me that!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.060
Remove the curse right now!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.810
I can't! Only you can do that!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.300
Do you really have time 
to dawdle around here?!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:37.720
I-I know that! I've been 
working as hard as I can!

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:40.610
Like before, when 
I went through all that...

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.610
I will defeat you!

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.620
For my kiss!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.410
Uh, that was the wrong 
kind of "working hard."

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.050
If that story is true,

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:00.420
all I have to do is kiss someone...

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.990
But I am troublesome, aren't I?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:08.150
I can't imagine anyone falling 
in love with me now...

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.440
Huh? Nishizawa-san?

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:14.850
What are you doing here?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:18.190
Afternoon classes should still 
be going on at Shiomi High.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:20.950
Y-Yeah... I just...

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:23.690
couldn't concentrate after 
that dream this morning...

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.620
Hey, come to think of it, this is...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.710
the place where you and I first met!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:42.200
Last year, you saved me 
when I was in danger.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.470
See? Right here.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:50.470
You don't... remember?

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.260
<i>Oh, yeah...</i>

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.290
<i>After that, I left Shiomi High...</i>

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.940
<i>I love you, Ayasaki-kun!</i>

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.950
<i>I wonder if she still 
feels the same way?</i>

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.320
<i>I never found out...</i>

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.320
<i>But if it's Nishizawa-san...</i>

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:11.830
<i>I can...</i>

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:16.620
By the way, Hayate-kun...

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:19.330
Have you heard this saying?

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:22.130
A saying?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.630
Yep!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.470
"If it's to help someone, 
there's no other choice!"

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:30.650
<i>Does this mean Nishizawa-san 
had the kiss dream, too?!</i>

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:33.350
<i>This is my chance! But...</i>

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.650
Yes! To help someone!

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.080
I'm pretty sure Gandhi once said it.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.710
"You'll have to hit people sometimes,

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.900
but if it's to help someone, 
there's no other choice!"

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.860
I don't think he said that...

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.510
Are you sure?!

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:51.370
<i>I feel a tremendous weight on me...</i>

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.370
Look at that, Sharna-chan!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.310
There's a couple getting ready to kiss!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.000
Relax, Fumi-chan.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.500
They're not necessarily about to kiss.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.320
W-Well, I'll see you later.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.970
I'm not going to kiss you or anything.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:06.890
O-Okay...

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:10.510
They separated! They separated 
without kissing, Sharna-chan!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:15.510
Done writing that list 
of kisses that failed?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.510
Failed List 
 1. Hinagiku-san 
2. Nishizawa-san 
3. Maria-san

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:17.350
This is no good.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.730
Could it be that you've 
never kissed a girl before?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.100
That's rude! I have kissed 
a girl before, you know!

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.110
Really?!

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.270
Go, you!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.240
Yes... in kindergarten...

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.740
Failed List 
 1. Hinagiku-san 
2. Nishizawa-san 
3. Maria-san 
4. A-tan

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.180
Incompetent fool!

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.170
Mind your own business!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.410
You really are hopeless.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.170
Failed List 
 1. Hinagiku-san 
2. Nishizawa-san 
3. Maria-san 
4. A-tan 
5. Ruka-san 
6. Chiharu-san

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.140
Shut up, shut your mouth!

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.840
I'll return the butler uniform!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.430
K-Kiss? Ayasaki-kun, 
what are you saying?

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:59.180
By the way, why didn't 
Maria-san have the kiss dream?

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.610
Well... you know...

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.120
We were kinda scared 
of the aftermath...

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.190
<b>Special Feature: Ruka Suirenji</b>

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.190
What? Who do I want to kiss?

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.440
Hm... Right now, there's not really...

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.950
Kiss...

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.510
Come to think of it, what was

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.450
that with Hayate-kun this morning?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.130
Hayate-kun...

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:21.290
Oh, Maria-san... Is Miss Nagi...

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.080
Yes, she's still fast asleep.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:28.100
She seems to be having 
a nice dream, though.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:31.370
Make sure you give her 
a good talking-to later, okay?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.590
<i>Uh oh... It looks like it was true.</i>

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.940
Oh, right... Ruka-san is on TV right now.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:37.520
<i>That means the time limit is only...</i>

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.350
This is a live broadcast.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.160
Hayate-kun?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.460
What's wrong?

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.700
N-Nothing! Not a thing!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.140
Well, that's good...

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:51.560
<i>That scared me! It was 
like a surprise attack!</i>

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:53.880
<i>Wait, a surprise attack?</i>

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.740
<i>That's it!</i>

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.320
<i>If I kiss her with a surprise attack
 and say it was an accident...</i>

00:16:58.130 --> 00:16:59.670
<i>I feel bad, but...</i>

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.910
<i>I'm doing this to help someone!</i>

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:03.620
Maria-san!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:04.790
Yes?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.090
Are you having fun?

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:09.800
No.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.060
<i>This won't work.</i>

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.920
<i>No matter what the 
circumstances, I can't force it.</i>

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.460
I know!

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.510
I'm going out for a bit!

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:21.870
Uh... Hayate-kun?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.480
This has been...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.800
a very strange day...

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.320
<i>Kiss... I have to get that kiss, fast!</i>

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.950
No! What's really important is love!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.450
You're such a grown-up.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.400
I think a kiss is like

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:47.420
a reward that shows someone 
how much you care about them.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.600
Nope, I still can't reach Hayate-kun.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:50.210
So nobody's seen him since then?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.750
How can you just ask to kiss me

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.080
out of nowhere like some 
kind of degenerate?!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.690
S-Sorry! I'll ask someone else!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:23.980
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.500
<i>If what Saginomiya-san and 
the others said is true...</i>

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:30.950
<i>But...</i>

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.590
A kiss would be...

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:47.590
I just can't beat him...

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:50.170
This is one tough boss...

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.190
At a time like this...

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:05.950
Hinagiku-san

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:05.950
Call
Send Message

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.990
You called about Hayate-kun?

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:12.480
Yes... Actually, I'm 
looking for him, too.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.430
What happened?

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.040
What?

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.550
Nagi is...

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:25.010
What is this about?

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.310
So, what is this about?

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.570
Asking if you can kiss me...

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.370
Well...

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.340
I sense...

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.340
a great awkwardness.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.950
Isumi-san?! Wh-Why...

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:46.370
Actually, my monster antenna

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.450
has picked up a very ominous presence.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.750
Monster antenna? 
Isn't that just bedhead?

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.970
It's been called that.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.460
It's just bedhead, then.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.470
But it's a fact that I sense 
an ominous presence.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:02.180
Hayate-sama, has anything 
unusual happened recently?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.170
Well, this morning,
 I had a strange dream...

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:09.110
Stories about dreams don't matter.

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:11.690
Wait, just hear this one out...

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:16.110
A clock and a tanuki 
threatened you in a dream?

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.210
Yes.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:20.920
I see. That is indeed curious.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.360
But isn't it just a dream?

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:27.370
If other people say they've 
also had strange dreams,

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:31.000
it's a clear sign of something ominous.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.710
Hey!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.780
Listen to this! I had a dream

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:39.550
that Hayata-kun tried
 to kiss me this morning.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.960
I did, too. What about you, Izumi?

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.510
Uh...

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.510
So it was all troublesome 
people who had this dream...

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:52.240
<i>This sounds like it's a lot 
worse than I thought.</i>

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.400
<i>The time limit those two 
Freakamon gave me was...</i>

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:00.540
The stroke of midnight, 
like I told you.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:03.020
If you're so much as one second late,

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:07.240
you will be separated 
from Nagi-chan forever!

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.540
Separated forever?

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.630
What do you mean by that?!

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:12.430
Who knows?

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.250
Don't joke around!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.570
Another summons?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.750
Really, that slave driver...

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.330
Here we go.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.330
Wow, a hidden world!

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.270
Guess I'm still a long 
way from the ending.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.060
Miss Nagi!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.300
We clear, Hayate Ayasaki?

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:44.640
Make that kiss happen by midnight!

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:49.580
This is your last chance to cease 
the cries of the black camellia!

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:51.220
If you fail...

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:56.420
You will be separated 
from your mistress forever!

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:22.150
<i>Just hold on...</i>

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:25.780
<i>If I kiss this drunk by midnight,
 I can save Miss Nagi!</i>

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:20.790
<b>Next Time</b>
